#
# Standard rainbow colortable for hue = 300 (magenta) to 0 (red)
#
#----------------------------------------------------------
# COLOR_MODEL = RGB
#----------------------------------------------------------
0.0    192/192/192    0.125    255/0/0
0.125  255/0/0        0.25     255/127/0
0.25   255/127/0      0.375    255/255/0
0.375  255/255/0      0.5      0/255/0
0.5    0/255/0        0.625    0/255/255
0.625  0/255/255      0.75     0/0/255
0.75   0/0/255        0.875    75/0/130
0.875  75/0/130       1.0      255/0/255

B   black
F   white
N   white
#----------------------------------------------------------
